-quantum procedure is conditional on Assumptions 1 and 2; it is not used to generate or
-grade these instances.
+The compressed route is to notice that all six desired weights have the same residue
+modulo 997. The target then determines that residue and one scan recovers the six
+indices. The measured route is 158 exact operations. The gap is therefore about 2.04
+million operations versus 158, but a bare no-tool solver must first discover the
+unannounced modulus. Sections III–IV's proposed quantum method is conditional on
+Assumptions 1 and 2; it is not used to manufacture or certify these instances.
 
