codex
One audit improvement is warranted before finalizing: because the generator itself introduces a fixed small modulus, a construction-aware program can discover it by scanning candidate moduli—faster than generic meet-in-the-middle, though still far beyond hand execution. I’m adding and measuring that successful Track B reference route outside the failing attack panel, so the hardness claim reports the strongest known mechanical shortcut rather than only the generic algorithm.
