Completed as a native Track B fixed-cardinality subset-sum generator, based on the paper’s Section I definition and Sections III–IV analysis ([arXiv paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/1707.08730)).

- [Generator](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1707.08730/gen_1707_08730.py)
- [Self-test report](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1707.08730/selftest_report.json): all G1–G9 gates pass
- [README](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1707.08730/README.md)
- [Bare oracle transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1707.08730/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl): hardened, 0/3 solved
- [Hinted transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1707.08730/g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl): 2/3 solved
- [Placebo transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1707.08730/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl): no valid attempts because OpenRouter reached its total-key limit

Shipping preset is `easy`, with `n=150`. Automatic modulus discovery costs about 101,305 operations, generic meet-in-the-middle 2,040,862 operations, and the recognized invariant route 158 operations. The final submit-style local preflight passes.
